{
  "name": "dsh-delivery-cards",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：独立的交付卡片行——卡片空白处点击进侧边栏预览，另有两个常驻按钮「打开」（默认程序）与「定位」（文件资源管理器）；11 类文件类型图标、亮暗双主题、零依赖零构建。作为 priority -2 的 turnTail 链参与者，在存在 present 声明的回合接替渲染，绕开其它插件对该链的抢占。v2.0 新增客户端兜底层：presented 为空时按路径/格式/大小启发式过滤 produced，对未训练模型（Kimi/Claude/GPT/Gemini/通义等）也能 render 交付卡片——不再依赖 DSH 官方只对 DeepSeek Flash 4.1 做的 present 训练。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/vclike/dsh-delivery-cards.git"
  },
  "homework": "https://github.com/vclike/dsh-delivery-cards#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/vclike/dsh-delivery-cards/issues"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deliverables",
    "present",
    "turn-tail",
    "delivery-card",
    "file-icons",
    "heuristic-fallback",
    "model-agnostic"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/helpers.test.js"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-chat"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": "^0.1.5-rc.1"
  }
}